# ── Not published ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The conversation layer: system prompt, streaming tool loop, and the Calendar /
# Twilio tool implementations. Kept in the private working tree, not shipped
# with the public repo. See "What's not in it" in the README.
src/prompt.js
src/agent.js
src/tools/

